  "title": "&#34;Dry&#34; Mexican Noodle Soup (Sopa Seca de Fideos)",
  "description": "Fried fideo noodles add flavor to this Mexican tomato soup that&#39;s quick to make, doubling as an easy stew or dippable tomato sauce.",
  "authors": [
    "Josefina Mijares"
  ],
  "date_published": "2019-04-04T00:11:04-04:00",
